WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:02.760
Good

00:04.200 --> 00:05.680
General Shilang is decisive

00:05.760 --> 00:07.160
General, please rise

00:07.760 --> 00:09.760
But I have one more condition

00:09.920 --> 00:11.920
That imperial jade seal

00:12.920 --> 00:14.320
That seal

00:14.520 --> 00:17.187
I lost it when I was driven out

00:17.400 --> 00:18.320
Now

00:18.400 --> 00:20.400
I don't know where it is

00:22.200 --> 00:23.600
Forget it

00:24.120 --> 00:25.520
Someone

00:26.000 --> 00:27.400
Give the general weapons and supplies

00:27.520 --> 00:28.920
I'll also give the general

00:29.000 --> 00:30.667
Two hundred sets of armor

00:31.400 --> 00:32.400
General

00:32.560 --> 00:34.560
Must help me block Qingzhou Army

00:34.760 --> 00:35.760
Your Highness

00:35.840 --> 00:37.440
Wait for my news

00:45.000 --> 00:58.000
Thereupon, they immediately reneged on their pledge, turning instead to attack the Yuyang and Yiyang regions with no intention whatsoever of obstructing the Qingzhou Army.

00:58.200 --> 01:04.500
A few days later, the main force of the Qingzhou Army caught up with you after all, and you were forced to engage them.

01:04.920 --> 01:06.320
After days of bitter fighting

01:06.400 --> 01:08.240
Still unable to achieve victory

01:08.320 --> 01:10.520
Causing morale to gradually collapse

01:10.800 --> 01:13.800
Many worry the court will later settle accounts and execute them

01:13.880 --> 01:15.120
Defect one after another

01:15.280 --> 01:18.160
You unfortunately die tragically in the chaos

